{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And you shall return unto HaShem your Elohim.</b> Your repentance shall be for the sole purpose of doing the will of your Maker. This is the repentance the Sages, of blessed memory, described (Yoma 86a) as reaching the Throne of Glory." "<b>And you shall obey His voice, according to all that I command you this day.</b> Not the command of learned men, as you did previously." "<b>You and your children.</b> Even those born in that generation will recognize this, as it says: כִּי כֻלָּם יֵדְעוּ אוֹתִי לְמִקְּטַנָּם וְעַד גְּדוֹלָם (Jeremiah 31:33)." "<b>With all your heart.</b> That you not doubt in this." "<b>And with all your soul.</b> That the desiring soul not withhold from this, when you recognize the magnitude of the matter."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:22:35.396745170Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}